const oldMasterInput=$('#volume').oninput;$('#volume').oninput=()=>{oldMasterInput();if(ctx?.stagecueSpeechMaster)ramp(ctx.stagecueSpeechMaster.gain,+$('#volume').value/100,.03);reportController()};
